  "description": "Document 113 event contract for the events app/modules/equipment/aseptic_commands.py actually emits. 5 of the catalogue's 7 declared Document 40 events are implemented: AsepticOperationStarted, AsepticInterventionRecorded, UnplannedInterventionDetected, AsepticEnvironmentExcursionDetected, AsepticOperationCompleted. AsepticHoldTimeExceeded and AsepticOperationHeld are declared in 07_EVENT_CATALOGUE.yaml but have no producing code path -- aseptic hold-time-exceeded detection (a scheduled/background check) and a distinct hold-transition event (the module folds a critical excursion straight into AsepticEnvironmentExcursionDetected rather than a separate held event) are not yet built. Verified directly against source, not assumed.",
